  <!-- BRIEF ABOUT -->
  <div class="section-alt">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-label">Overview</div>
      <div class="section-title">About the Conference</div>
      <div class="section-rule"></div>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="text-content">
          <p>The conference is an international platform for researchers, academicians, industry professionals, research scholars and students to exchange knowledge and present innovative research in emerging areas of Computer Science and Intelligent Systems, focused on AI, Machine Learning, Generative AI, Data Science, Cybersecurity, Cloud and Edge Computing, IoT, Robotics, Quantum Computing, Software Engineering and next-generation computing paradigms.</p>
          <p>It seeks to foster interdisciplinary and international research collaboration, strengthen academia–industry interaction, address real-world technological challenges, and promote secure, sustainable, trustworthy and intelligent computing solutions.</p>
          <p>Organised by the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, SRM Institute of Science and Technology, Tiruchirappalli.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
            <h3>Publication</h3>
            <p>Conference proceedings are proposed for publication through a recognized scholarly publisher, subject to formal publisher approval. The final publisher, proceedings title, and DOI/ISBN details will be confirmed after formal approval.</p>
          </div>
